            <ArticleTitle>[Occult fractures of the internal tibial plateau].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>231-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Insufficiency bone fracture of the medial tibial plateau occurs in elderly patient. Pain and disability are important. Physical examination and initial X-Ray are note contributive. Insufficiency fracture appeared on bone scan as localised hyperfixation and as a slow intensity image of the medial tibial plateau on MR Imaging. Outcome is favorable with discharge.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
